 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? Fun. Send a personal note. Say something like, I'm so glad you' both getting married, it's a huge life event, and I know work keeps us busy. Maybe she's just excited. You could ask her politely not to ask, and maybe offer to show her the dress later. Listen and say you understand if she's upset. Then reassure her you' not trying to ignore her, and maybe suggest an outing together. Classic. Make sure to tell her ahead. And let your colleagues know in team message instead. Keep it short and friendly.",
